{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"exponentiation exponentiation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md","fileName":"Exponentiation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Exponentiation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Exponents and Roots]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Exponents and Roots","Base of a Power","Exponent","Grouping Symbols","Root","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"exponentiation exponentiation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md","fileName":"Exponentiation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Exponentiation","heading":"Exponentiation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Exponentiation is the operation that raises a base to a power. For a natural number (n\\geq1),\n\n$$a^n=\\underbrace{a\\cdot a\\cdots a}_{n\\text{ factors}}.$$\n\nHere (a) is the [[Base of a Power]] and (n) is the [[Exponent]]. Exponentiation abbreviates repeated multiplication, just as multiplication abbreviates repeated addition for natural numbers. It is evaluated before multiplication and addition unless [[Grouping Symbols]] specify another structure. Its inverse operation is expressed through a [[Root]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Exponents and Roots","Base of a Power","Exponent","Grouping Symbols","Root","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"exponentiation exponentiation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Exponentiation.md","fileName":"Exponentiation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Exponentiation","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Exponents and Roots","Base of a Power","Exponent","Grouping Symbols","Root","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}